{"repositoryId":1407026492,"availability":"available","full":"EthanXing-xyy/DailyStamp","name":"DailyStamp","description":"每日一枚 · One pop-art stamp a day: a wheel of aged stamps on kraft paper, printed in the browser, with a deadpan mood-medicine leaflet on the back. 一天一枚波普邮票，背面是情绪药品说明书。","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T09:20:49Z","updated":"2026-10-17T16:45:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://daily-stamp.netlify.app","topics":["canvas","generative-art","interaction-design","javascript","pop-art","stamps","web-app"],"demo":"https://daily-stamp.netlify.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.824Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.824Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.824Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.824Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One pop-art stamp a day. Loud clashing colour on the front, a deadpan \"mood medicine leaflet\" on the back.","Daily Stamp is a small front-end-only web app that works on phones and desktops. Its interface is in Chinese.","Live demo: (mirror: ). The first load takes a while, because all 24 stamps of the home are printed behind the loading screen."],"features":["The home is an endless wheel of stamps. Each stamp opens one of 24 features.","The stamps are printed in the browser: 96 mood words, 16 clashing palettes and 10 layouts, dealt afresh on every visit.","Turn a stamp over and you get a \"mood medicine leaflet\": ingredients, indications, adverse reactions, contraindications, all of it.","The app never calls a model at runtime and has no back end. The build is a plain static site."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/EthanXing-xyy/DailyStamp/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"459d98d67c16c78868f1a219452bf4403665929eed0c2c189daeefec50014f8b","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.915Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.915Z","project